derivation: |
  Every <li class="ad-listitem"> removed from #srchrslt-adtable, leaving the ul
  itself and every other byte of the page untouched:

      awk 'NR<6828 || NR>11689' kleinanzeigen_2026_08_20.html

note: |
  A genuinely narrow search returns a page like this one, and it must not be read
  as "we cannot parse this portal". Derived rather than captured because no live
  search we are allowed to run returns zero results on demand; deriving keeps every
  byte of the real page's shell, which a hand-written stub would not.
